A1. An empty purse snatcher. ~ APRILFOOL
A9. Short shavings. ~ SHREDS
A11. You can have your meals brought up on these. ~ LINERS
A14. Old-fashioned things women used to make. ~ HOMES
A15. This fills Ein Stein. ~ ALE
A16. The end of Jumping Jehosophat. ~ AT
A17. This fellow is certainly a card. ~ JOKER
