A26. Soft drinks. ~ SODAS
A27. Stingers. ~ WASPS
A29. When words fail you, say it with this. ~ ER
A30. A cutup in the garden. ~ HOER
A31. How poets get over. ~ OER
A32. South America. ~ SA
A33. People who always need money. ~ RELATIVES
A35. A household necessity. ~ MA
A37. This is almost easy. ~ EAS
