D9. If Easter falls on April 1st, this usually does, too. ~ SHOWER
D10. Pokey's companion. ~ HOKEY
D12. Pours. ~ RAINS
D13. Shows the bare facts. ~ STRIPS
D17. Gag. ~ JOKE
D18. You can hear this on all sides—at least all that are left. ~ HEARTBEAT
D20. Lohengrin's girl friend. ~ ELSA
D22. At last! Here's a cap that will remain stationery. ~ FOOLS
D23. We hadn't any for this. ~ IDEA
